  "Free designs are the most expensive thing you give away.",
  "Say one kitchen layout takes you six hours.",
  "You do ten a month to win jobs.",
  "That's sixty hours of design work.",
  "Three of them sign. Seven walk away with your layout.",
  "Some of them hand it to a cheaper contractor.",
  "Forty-two hours a month, working for someone else.",
  "Real talk, you still need to show them something.",
  "Just not a full design before they've signed.",
  "Show them their own room, finished, from two phone photos.",
  "Our own remodeling company went from three in ten to five or six in ten.",
  "Your first tour is free. Link in bio."
